    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάπον-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, of
		persons, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exercised, hardy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>worn out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα δ. πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.135f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>
			<i>with labour</i> or <i>toil,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
